<title>UK: BAA up as market hails traffic figures.</title>
<headline>BAA up as market hails traffic figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BAA Plc advanced on Thursday after the company reported robust traffic growth figures for May.</p>
<p>By 0940 GMT BAA were up 6p to 556p.</p>
<p>&quot;The figures were very, very good&quot;, one trader said. &quot;They underline the company's bright outlook&quot;.</p>
<p>Earlier the British airports operator said it achieved passenger growth of 8.9 percent in its seven airports while cargo rose by 6.5 percent in May to 131,031 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
